# Move to from the Overdue view files the focused entry under another project and leaves the pane on the view, the entry now under its new project.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
Work:
	- Write report @due({today-2})
Home:
	- Pay rent @due({today-7})
END
keys gO gm
see Move to
type work
keys <Enter>
see ▌ - Pay rent  Work
see 󰨱 Overdue
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
Work:
	- Write report @due({today-2})
	- Pay rent @due({today-7})
Home:
END
